  storyText: "Delamain\n\nThe cab's AI speaks in a polite British voice. \"Good evening. I must note there is an unregistered intelligence on board. I shall pretend I did not notice.\"\n\n\"Where to?\"\n\n1. \"Pacifica.\"\n2. \"The Badlands.\"\n3. \"Just get me out of Watson.\""
